#: ../../source/reference/privacy.rst:2
msgid "Privacy, Secrets, and Support Data"
msgstr "隐私、密钥与支持数据"

#: ../../source/reference/privacy.rst:4
msgid ""
"Studio can see the project context you provide and the files that "
"approved tools read or change. The configured model provider receives the"
" request and the context needed to answer it. External MCP servers, "
"browser services, and web search are additional destinations that you "
"choose to enable."
msgstr "Studio 可以看到你提供的项目上下文，以及已批准工具读取或修改的文件。已配置的模型供应商会接收请求和回答所需的上下文。外部 MCP server、浏览器服务和网页搜索是你选择启用的额外目的地。"

#: ../../source/reference/privacy.rst:10
msgid "What to protect"
msgstr "需要保护什么"

#: ../../source/reference/privacy.rst:12
msgid ""
"Keep the following out of prompts and attachments unless you have a "
"specific, reviewed reason to share them:"
msgstr "除非有明确且经过审查的分享理由，否则请不要将以下内容放入提示词和附件："

#: ../../source/reference/privacy.rst:15
msgid "provider API keys and access tokens;"
msgstr "供应商 API key 和访问 token；"

#: ../../source/reference/privacy.rst:16
msgid "MCP environment variables, headers, and secrets;"
msgstr "MCP 环境变量、headers 和 secret；"

#: ../../source/reference/privacy.rst:17
msgid "browser passwords, cookies, and private profile data;"
msgstr "浏览器密码、cookie 和私密配置文件数据；"

#: ../../source/reference/privacy.rst:18
msgid "signing certificates and deployment credentials;"
msgstr "签名证书和部署凭据；"

#: ../../source/reference/privacy.rst:19
msgid "unrelated personal documents;"
msgstr "无关的个人文档；"

#: ../../source/reference/privacy.rst:20
msgid "unredacted logs containing usernames, absolute paths, or project secrets."
msgstr "包含用户名、绝对路径或项目 secret 的未脱敏日志。"

#: ../../source/reference/privacy.rst:23
msgid "Local runtime data"
msgstr "本地运行时数据"

#: ../../source/reference/privacy.rst:25
msgid ""
"Daedalus runtime data normally lives under "
"``%USERPROFILE%\\\\.daedalus``. It can include session messages, "
"attachments, tool results, project names, file paths, and diagnostics. "
"Inspect and sanitize it before copying it to another computer or "
"attaching it to an issue."
msgstr "Daedalus 运行时数据通常位于 ``%USERPROFILE%\\.daedalus`` 下。它可能包含会话消息、附件、工具结果、项目名称、文件路径和诊断信息。复制到其他电脑或附加到 issue 前，请检查并脱敏。"

#: ../../source/reference/privacy.rst:30
msgid ""
"Keys are stored through the operating-system credential store rather than"
" in ordinary configuration files. This protects storage at rest, but it "
"does not make it safe to paste a key into a prompt or expose it through a"
" custom tool."
msgstr "密钥通过操作系统凭据存储保存，而不是写入普通配置文件。这可以保护静态存储中的密钥，但不代表将 key 粘贴到提示词中或通过自定义工具暴露它是安全的。"

#: ../../source/reference/privacy.rst:35
msgid "Safe bug reports"
msgstr "安全的错误报告"

#: ../../source/reference/privacy.rst:37
msgid ""
"Include the Studio, backend, and Godot versions; the smallest "
"reproduction; the relevant workspace type; and sanitized startup or "
"session diagnostics. Remove API keys, custom MCP secrets, private file "
"contents, and unnecessary absolute paths."
msgstr "请提供 Studio、后端和 Godot 版本、最小复现步骤、相关工作区类型，以及脱敏后的启动或会话诊断。移除 API key、自定义 MCP secret、私有文件内容和不必要的绝对路径。"

#: ../../source/reference/privacy.rst:43
msgid "Review before external actions"
msgstr "外部操作前审查"

#: ../../source/reference/privacy.rst:45
msgid ""
"The approval gateway separates read, verify, propose, write, and "
"destructive operations. Still review the target, command, endpoint, and "
"changed files before approving. A local integration can be powerful "
"without being safe for every project."
msgstr "审批网关会区分 read、verify、propose、write 和 destructive 操作。批准前仍请审查目标、命令、endpoint 和变更文件。本地集成可能功能强大，但不一定对每个项目都安全。"
